     class's total cap, the oldest goes first). It has no attacks of its own: necro_minions.lua makes it hit the creature it
     targets every 2 s from up to 4 sqm (energy), fragile, dealt as its owner so the damage counts for the owner. Health is a placeholder below the monster
     tiers' minimum (no tier roll at creation); the spell sets the real health from the owner's level and magic level.
     Look 99 is an existing look of the client pair (no new art). Pushable; monsters never enter protection zones (the minions rest there). -->
